{% include "loading" %}

<style>

  .grid-container{
    grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
    column-gap: 20px;
    grid-row-gap: 80px;
    display: grid;
    margin: 94px 40px 0 240px;
    grid-template-rows: calc(100vh - 94px) 70vh 100vh;
  }

  h1{
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 22px;
    letter-spacing: .02em;
    text-transform: capitalize;
    padding: 0 0 36px 0;
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  p{
    margin-top: -4px;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 26px;
  }
  .cover-image{
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }


  .first-block-text{
    grid-column: 1 / span 5;
    grid-row: 1;
    align-self: end;
    display: flex;
    flex-flow: column;
    padding-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .first-image{
    grid-column: 7 / span 6;
    grid-row: 1;
    padding-bottom: 32px;
  }
.product-title{
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 22px;
    padding: 0 0 36px 0;
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 400;
}
.product-price{
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 21px;
    display: block;
    padding-top: ;
    padding-bottom: 26px;
}
.product-description{
    margin-top: -4px;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 21px;
}

.second-block-text{
    grid-column: 1 / span 4;
    grid-row: 2;
    align-self: end;
    display: flex;
    flex-flow: column;
}
.preview-image{
  width: 80px;
  padding-bottom: 26px;
  object-fit: cover;
  object-position: center;

}
.second-block-image-1{
  grid-column: 5 / span 4;
  grid-row: 2;
}

.second-block-image-2{
  grid-column: 9 / span 4;
  grid-row: 2;
}

.third-block-text{
    grid-column: 1 / span 4;
    grid-row: 3;
    display: flex;
    flex-flow: column;
}

.third-block-image-1{
  grid-column: 5 / span 8;
  grid-row: 3;
}



</style>

<div class="grid-container">

  <!--SECTION 1-->
    <div class="heading first-block-text" >

      <h1>Trip to Dia: Beacon for High Summer</h1>
      <p>For Adsum’s third release of the SS22 season, we focus on our European manufacturing partnership to bring a selection of luxurious and utilitarian garments, all part of the High Summer release. The lookbook was shot in and around a trip up to Dia: Beacon from Grand Central Station, a common, almost rite of passage trip, for creatives living in New York City.</p>
    </div>

    <img class="cover-image first-image" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/MG_7401.jpg?v=1653421754">

  <!--SECTION 2-->
    <div class="product-write-up second-block-text">
      <a href="https://adsumnyc.com/products/gd-m97-jacket-golden-moss">
        <img class="preview-image" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/products/GARMENT-DYED-PACK0287-m97-golden-moss.jpg?v=1652715798">
      </a>
      <div class="product-heading">
        <a class="product-title" href="https://adsumnyc.com/products/gd-m97-jacket-golden-moss" class="product-title">GD M97 Jacket</a>
        <a class="product-price" href="https://adsumnyc.com/products/gd-m97-jacket-golden-moss" class="product-title">$355</a>
      </div>
      <a class="product-description">The Garment Dyed M97 Jacket. Contructed from a 70% cotton 30% nylon blend canvas. It’s far from a workwear duck canvas jacket. The fabric we used has a hand that is cool and smooth to touch with a 240 GSM weight. We sourced it from a famous outerwear mill located near the shores of Lake Como, Italy.</a>
    </div>
    <img class="cover-image second-block-image-1" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/Look1_003.jpg?v=1653421753">
    <img class="cover-image second-block-image-2" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/products/GARMENT-DYED-PACK0287-m97-golden-moss.jpg?v=1652715798">




  <!--SECTION 3-->
    <div class="product-write-up third-block-text">
      <a href="https://adsumnyc.com/products/gd-m97-jacket-golden-moss">
        <img class="preview-image" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/products/GARMENT-DYED-PACK0287-m97-golden-moss.jpg?v=1652715798">
      </a>
      <div class="product-heading">
        <a class="product-title" href="https://adsumnyc.com/products/gd-m97-jacket-golden-moss" class="product-title">GD M97 Jacket</a>
        <a class="product-price" href="https://adsumnyc.com/products/gd-m97-jacket-golden-moss" class="product-title">$355</a>
      </div>
      <a class="product-description">The Garment Dyed M97 Jacket. Contructed from a 70% cotton 30% nylon blend canvas. It’s far from a workwear duck canvas jacket. The fabric we used has a hand that is cool and smooth to touch with a 240 GSM weight. We sourced it from a famous outerwear mill located near the shores of Lake Como, Italy.</a>
    </div>
    <img class="cover-image third-block-image-1" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/Look2_014.jpg?v=1653421753">

  </div>



</div>








